<%- include('partials/header', { title: 'Terms & Rental Agreement - Location YBMTL' }) %>

<div class="container conditions-page">
  <a class="back-link" href="/en">&larr; Back to home</a>

  <div class="conditions-content">
    <h1>Terms &amp; Rental Agreement</h1>

    <p>Before renting a vehicle from Location YBMTL, please read our general terms and our rental agreement carefully.</p>

    <div class="contract-section">
      <h2>Rental agreement</h2>
      <p>View and download our complete rental agreement. It is available in <strong>three languages</strong>.</p>
      <div class="doc-grid">
        <a class="doc-card" href="/docs/Vehicle-Rental-Agreement-YBMTL-EN.pdf" download>
          <span class="doc-flag">🇬🇧</span>
          <span class="doc-text"><strong>English</strong><small>Courtesy translation · PDF</small></span>
          <span class="doc-dl">Download&nbsp;→</span>
        </a>
        <a class="doc-card" href="/docs/Contrat-Location-YBMTL-FR-avec-Annexe-A.pdf" download>
          <span class="doc-flag">🇫🇷</span>
          <span class="doc-text"><strong>Français</strong><small>Official version · agreement + Annex A · PDF</small></span>
          <span class="doc-dl">Télécharger&nbsp;→</span>
        </a>
        <a class="doc-card" href="/docs/Contrato-de-Alquiler-YBMTL-ES.pdf" download>
          <span class="doc-flag">🇪🇸</span>
          <span class="doc-text"><strong>Español</strong><small>Courtesy translation · PDF</small></span>
          <span class="doc-dl">Descargar&nbsp;→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <p class="muted small">Agreement (4 pages) + Annex A (3 pages) · PDF · The French version is the official version; the English and Spanish versions are courtesy translations, annex included.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="contract-section" id="fees">
      <h2>Annex A: fee schedule and additional terms</h2>
      <p>Every possible fee is written down in advance. Annex A is an integral part of the agreement: cancellation, deposit refund, accident or breakdown, use of the vehicle, additional driver, and more. The table below is a courtesy summary in English; the French Annex A is the official version.</p>
      <div class="table-scroll">
        <table class="frais-table">
          <thead><tr><% annexe.tableEn.entetes.forEach(function (h) { %><th scope="col"><%= h %></th><% }); %></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <% annexe.tableEn.lignes.forEach(function (l) { %><tr><% l.forEach(function (c) { %><td><%= c %></td><% }); %></tr><% }); %>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p class="muted small">These fees may be deducted from the security deposit. Taxes are added where they apply.</p>
      <div class="doc-grid">
        <a class="doc-card" href="/docs/Annex-A-Additional-Terms-YBMTL-EN.pdf" download>
          <span class="doc-flag">🇬🇧</span>
          <span class="doc-text"><strong>Annex A</strong><small>Courtesy translation · PDF</small></span>
          <span class="doc-dl">Download&nbsp;→</span>
        </a>
        <a class="doc-card" href="/docs/Annexe-A-Conditions-Complementaires-YBMTL-FR.pdf" download>
          <span class="doc-flag">🇫🇷</span>
          <span class="doc-text"><strong>Annexe A</strong><small>Official version (French) · PDF</small></span>
          <span class="doc-dl">Télécharger&nbsp;→</span>
        </a>
        <a class="doc-card" href="/docs/Anexo-A-Condiciones-Complementarias-YBMTL-ES.pdf" download>
          <span class="doc-flag">🇪🇸</span>
          <span class="doc-text"><strong>Anexo A</strong><small>Courtesy translation (Spanish) · PDF</small></span>
          <span class="doc-dl">Descargar&nbsp;→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="contract-section">
      <h2>Clear guide: insurance &amp; &ldquo;who pays what&rdquo;</h2>
      <p>A simple, complete summary of the insurance coverage and your responsibilities, so there are no surprises.</p>
      <div class="doc-grid">
        <a class="doc-card" href="/docs/Insurance-Guide-YBMTL-EN.pdf" download>
          <span class="doc-flag">🇬🇧</span>
          <span class="doc-text"><strong>English</strong><small>Renter's guide · PDF</small></span>
          <span class="doc-dl">Download&nbsp;→</span>
        </a>
        <a class="doc-card" href="/docs/Guide-Assurances-YBMTL-FR.pdf" download>
          <span class="doc-flag">🇫🇷</span>
          <span class="doc-text"><strong>Français</strong><small>Guide du locataire · PDF</small></span>
          <span class="doc-dl">Télécharger&nbsp;→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="conditions-summary">
      <h2>Summary of the main terms</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Booking:</strong> Bookings are made by online request. We confirm by phone or email.</li>
        <li><strong>Payment:</strong> No online payment. The rental and the security deposit are paid directly to Location YBMTL, no later than when the vehicle is handed over: Interac e-transfer or cash. No credit card is required.</li>
        <li><strong>Taxes:</strong> Starting October 1, 2026, GST (5%) and QST (9.975%) are added to the rental price, excluding the security deposit. The prices shown are before taxes.</li>
        <li><strong>Insurance:</strong> Every rental includes basic insurance (third-party liability). Damage to the rented vehicle remains the renter's responsibility: see our &ldquo;who pays what&rdquo; guide above.</li>
        <li><strong>Security deposit:</strong> A security deposit is required before the vehicle is handed over (amount shown on each vehicle's page). It is refunded within 3 days after the return, minus any amounts owed, with a $150 precautionary hold kept for 14 days.</li>
        <li><strong>Mileage:</strong> Unlimited.</li>
        <li><strong>Cancellation:</strong> Free up to 24 hours before departure; after that, or if you do not show up, $50.</li>
        <li><strong>Use:</strong> No paid ride-sharing, passenger transport or delivery work (Uber, DoorDash, etc.) without our written permission; no smoking or vaping. Driving in Canada and the United States is allowed.</li>
        <li><strong>Vehicle condition:</strong> A condition report is completed before and after the rental to protect everyone.</li>
        <li><strong>Minimum age:</strong> The main driver must be at least 25 years old and hold a driver's licence that has been valid for at least 3 years.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="conditions-contact">
      <h2>Questions?</h2>
      <p>For any question about our terms or our agreement, feel free to contact us:</p>
      <p>
        <strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:<%= company.phone.replace(/[^0-9+]/g,'') %>"><%= company.phone %></a><br>
        <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:<%= company.email %>"><%= company.email %></a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
